{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow","slug":"the-lonely-scarecrow","title":"The Lonely Scarecrow","title_ko":"외로운 허수아비","level":"A1","ageBand":"8-10","coverUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/cover.webp","summary_ko":"새를 쫓느라 외롭던 허수아비가 작은 새들과 친구가 되는 따뜻한 이야기.","wordCount":114,"pages":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p1","pageNo":1,"spread":"p1","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p1.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p1-s1","ord":0,"text":"Sam the scarecrow stood in a big field.","translation_ko":"허수아비 샘은 넓은 밭에 서 있었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p1-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Sam","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":480},{"word":"the","charStart":4,"charEnd":7,"startMs":480,"endMs":680},{"word":"scarecrow","charStart":8,"charEnd":17,"startMs":680,"endMs":1200},{"word":"stood","charStart":18,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1720},{"word":"in","charStart":24,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1720,"endMs":1960},{"word":"a","charStart":27,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1960,"endMs":2140},{"word":"big","charStart":29,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2140,"endMs":2420},{"word":"field","charStart":33,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2420,"endMs":2740}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p2","pageNo":2,"spread":"p2","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p2.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p2-s1","ord":0,"text":"Birds flew down to eat the seeds.","translation_ko":"새들이 날아와 씨앗을 먹으려 했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p2-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Birds","charStart":0,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":540},{"word":"flew","charStart":6,"charEnd":10,"startMs":540,"endMs":840},{"word":"down","charStart":11,"charEnd":15,"startMs":840,"endMs":1200},{"word":"to","charStart":16,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1200,"endMs":1380},{"word":"eat","charStart":19,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1520},{"word":"the","charStart":23,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1520,"endMs":1760},{"word":"seeds","charStart":27,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1760,"endMs":2020}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p2-s2","ord":1,"text":"Sam waved his arms and scared them away.","translation_ko":"샘은 팔을 흔들어 새들을 쫓아 버렸어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p2-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Sam","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":620,"endMs":1100},{"word":"waved","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1380},{"word":"his","charStart":10,"charEnd":13,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1620},{"word":"arms","charStart":14,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1620,"endMs":1880},{"word":"and","charStart":19,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1880,"endMs":2320},{"word":"scared","charStart":23,"charEnd":29,"startMs":2320,"endMs":2480},{"word":"them","charStart":30,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2480,"endMs":2680},{"word":"away","charStart":35,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2680,"endMs":2920}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p3","pageNo":3,"spread":"p3","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p3.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p3-s1","ord":0,"text":"The birds flew off, but Sam felt alone.","translation_ko":"새들은 날아가 버렸지만, 샘은 외로웠어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p3-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"birds","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":240,"endMs":600},{"word":"flew","charStart":10,"charEnd":14,"startMs":600,"endMs":900},{"word":"off","charStart":15,"charEnd":18,"startMs":900,"endMs":1260},{"word":"but","charStart":20,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1660,"endMs":1860},{"word":"Sam","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2120},{"word":"felt","charStart":28,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2120,"endMs":2420},{"word":"alone","charStart":33,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2420,"endMs":2780}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p4","pageNo":4,"spread":"p4","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p4.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p4-s1","ord":0,"text":"No one talked to him all day.","translation_ko":"온종일 아무도 그에게 말을 걸지 않았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p4-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"No","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"one","charStart":3,"charEnd":6,"startMs":340,"endMs":580},{"word":"talked","charStart":7,"charEnd":13,"startMs":580,"endMs":920},{"word":"to","charStart":14,"charEnd":16,"startMs":920,"endMs":1140},{"word":"him","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1140,"endMs":1320},{"word":"all","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1320,"endMs":1680},{"word":"day","charStart":25,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1680,"endMs":1920}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p4-s2","ord":1,"text":"Sam looked at the empty sky and sighed.","translation_ko":"샘은 텅 빈 하늘을 바라보며 한숨을 쉬었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p4-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Sam","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":440},{"word":"looked","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":440,"endMs":700},{"word":"at","charStart":11,"charEnd":13,"startMs":700,"endMs":860},{"word":"the","charStart":14,"charEnd":17,"startMs":860,"endMs":1100},{"word":"empty","charStart":18,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1260},{"word":"sky","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1720},{"word":"and","charStart":28,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1720,"endMs":2520},{"word":"sighed","charStart":32,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2520,"endMs":2840}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p5","pageNo":5,"spread":"p5","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p5.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p5-s1","ord":0,"text":"One morning, a little bird landed near Sam.","translation_ko":"어느 날 아침, 작은 새 한 마리가 샘 곁에 내려앉았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p5-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"One","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"morning","charStart":4,"charEnd":11,"startMs":280,"endMs":660},{"word":"a","charStart":13,"charEnd":14,"startMs":900,"endMs":1080},{"word":"little","charStart":15,"charEnd":21,"startMs":1080,"endMs":1300},{"word":"bird","charStart":22,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1300,"endMs":1560},{"word":"landed","charStart":27,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1560,"endMs":1880},{"word":"near","charStart":34,"charEnd":38,"startMs":1880,"endMs":2240},{"word":"Sam","charStart":39,"charEnd":42,"startMs":2240,"endMs":2500}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p5-s2","ord":1,"text":"Sam waved, but the bird did not fly away.","translation_ko":"샘이 팔을 흔들었지만, 새는 날아가지 않았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p5-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Sam","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":400},{"word":"waved","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":400,"endMs":740},{"word":"but","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":1060,"endMs":1160},{"word":"the","charStart":15,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1160,"endMs":1380},{"word":"bird","charStart":19,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1560},{"word":"did","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1560,"endMs":1820},{"word":"not","charStart":28,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1820,"endMs":2100},{"word":"fly","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2340},{"word":"away","charStart":36,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2620}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p6","pageNo":6,"spread":"p6","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p6.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p6-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"Why do you look sad?\" sang the bird.","translation_ko":"\"왜 슬퍼 보여요?\" 새가 노래하듯 물었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p6-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Why","charStart":1,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":320},{"word":"do","charStart":5,"charEnd":7,"startMs":320,"endMs":520},{"word":"you","charStart":8,"charEnd":11,"startMs":520,"endMs":720},{"word":"look","charStart":12,"charEnd":16,"startMs":720,"endMs":960},{"word":"sad","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":960,"endMs":1440},{"word":"sang","charStart":23,"charEnd":27,"startMs":2060,"endMs":2100},{"word":"the","charStart":28,"charEnd":31,"startMs":2100,"endMs":2340},{"word":"bird","charStart":32,"charEnd":36,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2500}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p6-s2","ord":1,"text":"\"I have no friends,\" said Sam softly.","translation_ko":"\"저는 친구가 없어요.\" 샘이 조용히 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p6-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"I","charStart":1,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"have","charStart":3,"charEnd":7,"startMs":260,"endMs":560},{"word":"no","charStart":8,"charEnd":10,"startMs":560,"endMs":940},{"word":"friends","charStart":11,"charEnd":18,"startMs":940,"endMs":1820},{"word":"said","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1820,"endMs":1900},{"word":"Sam","charStart":26,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2260},{"word":"softly","charStart":30,"charEnd":36,"startMs":2260,"endMs":2720}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p7","pageNo":7,"spread":"p7","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p7.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p7-s1","ord":0,"text":"The bird flew up and sat in his hat.","translation_ko":"새는 날아올라 샘의 모자 위에 앉았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p7-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":240},{"word":"bird","charStart":4,"charEnd":8,"startMs":240,"endMs":520},{"word":"flew","charStart":9,"charEnd":13,"startMs":520,"endMs":820},{"word":"up","charStart":14,"charEnd":16,"startMs":820,"endMs":1100},{"word":"and","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1440},{"word":"sat","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1440,"endMs":1660},{"word":"in","charStart":25,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1660,"endMs":1780},{"word":"his","charStart":28,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1780,"endMs":1960},{"word":"hat","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":1960,"endMs":2220}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p7-s2","ord":1,"text":"She built a small nest inside it.","translation_ko":"새는 모자 안에 작은 둥지를 만들었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p7-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":280},{"word":"built","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":280,"endMs":520},{"word":"a","charStart":10,"charEnd":11,"startMs":520,"endMs":740},{"word":"small","charStart":12,"charEnd":17,"startMs":740,"endMs":1020},{"word":"nest","charStart":18,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1320},{"word":"inside","charStart":23,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1320,"endMs":1760},{"word":"it","charStart":30,"charEnd":32,"startMs":1760,"endMs":2000}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p8","pageNo":8,"spread":"p8","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p8.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p8-s1","ord":0,"text":"More birds came and sang around Sam.","translation_ko":"더 많은 새들이 날아와 샘 주변에서 노래했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p8-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"More","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"birds","charStart":5,"charEnd":10,"startMs":340,"endMs":700},{"word":"came","charStart":11,"charEnd":15,"startMs":700,"endMs":1060},{"word":"and","charStart":16,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1060,"endMs":1380},{"word":"sang","charStart":20,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1580},{"word":"around","charStart":25,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1580,"endMs":1900},{"word":"Sam","charStart":32,"charEnd":35,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2260}]}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p9","pageNo":9,"spread":"p9","imageUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/p9.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p9-s1","ord":0,"text":"Sam smiled and stood tall in the sun.","translation_ko":"샘은 미소 지으며 햇살 속에 당당히 서 있었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p9-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Sam","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":500},{"word":"smiled","charStart":4,"charEnd":10,"startMs":500,"endMs":980},{"word":"and","charStart":11,"charEnd":14,"startMs":980,"endMs":1440},{"word":"stood","charStart":15,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1440,"endMs":1560},{"word":"tall","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1560,"endMs":1960},{"word":"in","charStart":26,"charEnd":28,"startMs":1960,"endMs":2180},{"word":"the","charStart":29,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2180,"endMs":2340},{"word":"sun","charStart":33,"charEnd":36,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2560}]},{"id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-p9-s2","ord":1,"text":"He was not lonely anymore.","translation_ko":"샘은 이제 더 이상 외롭지 않았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-lonely-scarecrow/audio/p9-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":560},{"word":"was","charStart":3,"charEnd":6,"startMs":560,"endMs":840},{"word":"not","charStart":7,"charEnd":10,"startMs":840,"endMs":1220},{"word":"lonely","charStart":11,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1220,"endMs":1600},{"word":"anymore","charStart":18,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1600,"endMs":2220}]}]}],"quiz":[{"question_ko":"허수아비 샘은 어디에 서 있었나요?","type":"mc","options":["넓은 밭","학교 운동장","강가","숲속"],"answerIndex":0,"explain_ko":"샘은 넓은 밭에 서서 씨앗을 지키는 허수아비였어요.","id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-q1","ord":0},{"question_ko":"샘이 외로웠던 이유는 무엇인가요?","type":"mc","options":["비가 많이 왔기 때문에","모자를 잃어버렸기 때문에","모두를 쫓아 버려서 친구가 없었기 때문에","밭이 너무 넓었기 때문에"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"샘은 새들을 계속 쫓아 버렸기 때문에 친구가 하나도 없어서 외로웠어요.","id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-q2","ord":1},{"question_ko":"작은 새는 샘에게 다가왔을 때 무엇을 했나요?","type":"mc","options":["씨앗을 빼앗았다","도망갔다","샘의 모자에 둥지를 틀었다","샘의 팔을 물었다"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"작은 새는 날아올라 샘의 모자 안에 작은 둥지를 만들었어요.","id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-q3","ord":2},{"question_ko":"이야기 마지막에 샘의 기분은 어땠나요?","type":"mc","options":["여전히 외로웠다","무서웠다","슬프고 지쳤다","더 이상 외롭지 않고 행복했다"],"answerIndex":3,"explain_ko":"많은 새 친구들이 생긴 샘은 이제 더 이상 외롭지 않고 미소를 지었어요.","id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-q4","ord":3},{"question_ko":"작은 새가 샘에게 한 말은 무엇인가요?","type":"mc","options":["씨앗을 줘!","날아가!","왜 슬퍼 보여요?","집에 가!"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"작은 새는 \"왜 슬퍼 보여요?\"라고 노래하듯 샘에게 물었어요.","id":"the-lonely-scarecrow-q5","ord":4}]}